This repository is a fork of https://github.com/lazydroid/auto-update-apk-client
(Auto-Update-APK client, Copyright (c) 2012 lenik terenin, Apache License 2.0).

The original Eclipse-era sources remain in this repository's git history. The code in the
current tree is a rewrite against the android-apk-updater server; it keeps the original's
update-check protocol (POST pkgname/version/md5, reply "have update" + URL or "no update")
so existing deployments can switch by changing one URL.
